that's somewhere else that's not working.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.960
You know, often you see couches sitting in

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.720
the lobby where no one actually sits in

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:23.640
it, right? Bring it in, use it somewhere

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:26.040
else, right? It's so simple.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.960
Or just like removing obstacles, right?

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.320
It could be you know, this is a

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:30.520
thing that's getting in the way of

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:32.000
collaboration. All you have to do is get

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:32.360
rid of it.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:33.640
That's definitely free.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.240
Yeah. I so agree.

